  `J=f_xg_y-f_yg_x`. No such inference is needed because all three reduced
  charts are exact-Q unit ideals.
- The outer label “case (A) of `(99,66)`” is kept distinct from the two
  internal factors A and B of `K9-SPLIT`. Neither internal factor alone is
