+  input the exact N1 kill certificates, K16 EN-norm target, H1 pilot rows,
+  and routing-map obligations;
+  output which hypotheses feed which conclusions and which scope gaps remain.
+Wall: <2 hours, no CAS beyond manifest/hash reads and tiny source checks.
+```
+
+The single most valuable next mathematical object is the K16 EN-norm
+`N_t=Norm(widehat Q_t)`. The N1 finite kill list is the highest-value near-term
+deliverable, but it is already running. If batch3 fails, S1 becomes the
+immediate operational object; if batch3 finishes, K16 is the uncovered critical
