+Problem: the new frontier is no longer "one report, one computation." N1 and
+H1 both expand into many chart leaves, each with distinct source hypotheses,
+ring variables, localizers, emitted rows, solver outcomes, and exact-Q replay
+status. Today the evidence is spread across lane prose, JSON fragments, and
+solver directories. That is workable for a lane, but it is a bad interface for
+the coordinator and for collision/history checks.
