+  tag, parent skeleton/row, split/no-split, delta, partition,
+  source hypotheses, corrected exponent, ring variables and weights,
+  localizers, row-file hashes, union checksum, solver attempts,
+  verdict in the guided_gb vocabulary, exact-Q replay hash,
+  and promotion eligibility.
+
+Commands:
+  init, add-leaf, attach-rows, attach-solver, summarize, verify.
+```
